{
 "id": 1770940,
 "titulo": "10/18 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1666079163756,
 "modificada": 1733089695683,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1770940",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1642484088451\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb6d1abccb364a5981c9cb4a33768459_1642484088451_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nThis is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The mysterious witch and the king of the Inhumans<br>\nhave fallen to darkness.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Through this additional patch,<br>\na new Uniform and Tier-3 Advancement will be added to Morgan le Fay,<br>\nand a new Uniform and Tier-4 Advancement will be added to Black Bolt to show new powers!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the new skills and powers of the two Super Villains<br>\nby downloading the 10/18 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">■ 10/18 Patch Details</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><s><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 10/19 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 10/18 (Tue) 20:00 (PDT)</span></span></s><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><s><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[10/19 (Wed) 3:29 (UTC+0), 10/18 (Tue) 20:29 (PDT) added]</span><br>\nWe are sorry to inform our Agents who have been waiting for the patch that the patch is being delayed.<br>\nFurther notice will be made through this notice once the patch has been completed.</span></span></s></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[10/19 (Wed) 4:21 (UTC+0), 10/18 (Tue) 21:21 (PDT) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed as of 10/19 (Wed) 4:21 (UTC+0), 10/18 (Tue) 21:21 (PDT).&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances&nbsp;<br>\nand the </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">completion time will be announced</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"> once the patch has been finished.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\n* When the patch is done, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 10/18 Patch data is applied.<br>\n* The new Uniforms can be purchased during the event period.</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Black Bolt &lt;Fallen Soul&gt;:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 10/18 Patch - 11/1 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0), After the 10/18 Patch - 11/1 (Tue) 7:59 (PDT)&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Purchase method: Crystal purchase (Sale events will not be applied)</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Morgan le Fay &lt;Fallen Soul&gt;:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 10/18 Patch - 11/4 (Fri) 14:59 (UTC+0), After the 10/18 Patch - 11/4 (Fri) 7:59 (PDT)&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Purchase method: Can be exchanged at the Event Token Shop with Halloween Tokens</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Halloween Tokens can be acquired by purchasing event products or through other methods</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">until 11/1 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0), 11/1 (Tue) 7:59 (PDT).&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The &lt;Fallen Soul&gt; Uniforms may be available for purchase again&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">after the event has been over through similar events or packages.&nbsp;<br>\n* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats.<br>\n(Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6) &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1475\" id=\"1666074291875\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/893a9c0e251a485e84245434cccf9f25_1666074291875_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1215\" id=\"1666074291888\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/cd45e19ddc884ea1a83ceb8a71129749_1666074291888_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Morgan le Fay Tier-3 Advancement</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<br>\nMorgan le Fay is now available for Tier-3 Advancement.<br>\nCheck out her magic that has become even stronger!&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"357\" id=\"1666071320943\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/edbfbad0dff2455581c79a3928e983e7_1666071320943_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-abde324e-7fff-0761-784d-f32424a561c0\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"190\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/TiaCcMgAjkI1B5LlWiFNM0iLvn4Xi_n6s6uynT8qVTO3k5LmqpeJZ_tG-JeBFTaWMgcPhDfLUaYUnleCfWyNTkNwF57T0Xc8SRV8L-fwpCAaQ3zU4FVps30oetmTcrl6IaXnQuzSlIqYuhSbzk88mgEiW5d-ttYH6L-Y7tE9VXxIQGQ2EGsBUR--UQ\" width=\"340\"></b></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Black Bolt Tier-4 Advancement</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<br>\nBlack Bolt is now available for Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nThe voice of the king of the Inhumans will be fatal to the threatening enemies.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on skill level 6.</span><br>\n&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"316\" id=\"1666071355915\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/06859aa4a8f741b49e797f8ab76b0c2c_1666071355915_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Artifacts</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<br>\nNew Artifacts have been added for Morgan le Fay and Black Bolt.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Level 4 stats.</span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1666072141338\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0e45d5de8f414d11b391b59fc65d986b_1666072141338_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Other Improvements and Changes</strong></span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The skill usage order of Gorr &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ Thor: Love and Thunder</em>&gt;&nbsp;in Auto Play has been changed.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nWe look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated Super Villains.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nThank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1666070997161\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/682b8066d8de47b28c1954b86c60f2ad_1666070997161_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
